          "suite-socketio.yml",
          "suite-autobahn.yml"
        ],
        "reason": "The suites of MQTT, Engine.IO, SockJS, Socket.IO and Autobahn are not gates. They find faults of the clients, and their it.fails tests record them. They run only when a suite changes, each week and on a manual start."
